Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:12:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Give embedders completion values, console output, timers
 and node handles

evaluate_to_string returns a script's completion value (or its exception), take_console_messages keeps
console.* output by level, run_jobs/run_due_timers let an embedder drive the event loop, and the
__blitz_node_id/__blitz_node natives map DOM wrappers to DevTools-style node ids and back.
---
 src/document.rs | 35 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/runtime.rs  | 63 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 src/state.rs    |  3 +++
 3 files changed, 92 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

